            <image>
                <url><![CDATA[http://blogpfthumb.phinf.naver.net/MjAyNDAyMjFfNTUg/MDAxNzA4NDk3MjEyNjc1.x11cyJ5dR8mV7neskZT_JttbGvR5g9svgwLJTuECrnQg.JpYUaOW_ctUUK47goaEhbH2wCLpXbRvpVa1_3SVeBMQg.JPEG/Busan_MoCA_MI_Signature_V_Bk%2BWt_80-03.jpg/Busan%2BMoCA%2BMI_Signature_V_Bk%252BWt_80-03.jpg?type=m2]]></url>
                <title><![CDATA[부산현대미술관]]></title>
